WEBVTT

01:36.380 --> 01:41.020
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.400 --> 01:43.950
[Episode 5]

01:52.870 --> 01:53.479
Third Young Master.

01:53.259 --> 01:57.690
[Qianzhu Garden]

01:56.229 --> 01:58.130
Third Young Master,
Master Xiao has ordered

01:58.130 --> 02:00.330
that no one is to approach his quarters.

02:05.770 --> 02:08.960
Since when have his quarters been
so heavily guarded?

02:10.710 --> 02:14.040
If you have urgent matters,
I can inform him of your arrival.

02:16.360 --> 02:18.840
Never mind. It's nothing urgent.

02:20.400 --> 02:22.560
I just think you all look overworked.

02:37.400 --> 02:39.910
Mother deliberately changed
the subject earlier,

02:39.910 --> 02:42.370
and the quarters are
under such heavy guard.

02:42.770 --> 02:45.430
Is that dignitary
really at the Xiao Residence?

02:54.190 --> 02:54.920
Old Madam Wu!

02:56.150 --> 02:58.810
Could Old Madam Wu be here
at the Xiao Residence?

02:58.829 --> 03:01.200
I can't remember the specifics
of the plot,

03:01.200 --> 03:04.000
but I seem to recall her having
the Hero Command Token...

03:04.000 --> 03:06.060
That must be why she's being pursued.

03:06.430 --> 03:08.360
So this is where we are in the story.

03:09.360 --> 03:10.420
If that's the case,

03:10.800 --> 03:13.030
the security might be enough
to keep me out,

03:13.030 --> 03:15.430
but it won't hold back
a peak-level master.

03:15.630 --> 03:17.630
I'd better have a contingency plan.

03:21.800 --> 03:22.329
Come in.

03:30.630 --> 03:31.760
Greetings, My Lord.

03:32.400 --> 03:33.630
Did you find anything?

03:33.630 --> 03:34.190
My Lord,

03:34.750 --> 03:36.280
I haven't been with the Xiao family long,

03:36.280 --> 03:37.750
so I can't move around freely.

03:37.750 --> 03:39.520
But recently, they've added guards
near Xiao Xilou's quarters

03:39.520 --> 03:41.750
at the Qianzhu Garden.

03:42.240 --> 03:43.430
If they're hiding someone,

03:43.430 --> 03:45.160
that's most likely where it is.

03:46.590 --> 03:47.800
Qianzhu Garden

04:16.870 --> 04:17.600
Sect Leader.

04:18.070 --> 04:19.000
What's going on?

04:19.190 --> 04:21.190
Why are all the lights suddenly lit?

04:21.829 --> 04:23.960
It was the Third Young Master's order.

04:24.600 --> 04:25.260
Where is he?

04:25.740 --> 04:26.670
Father, Mother.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.560
I did give the order.

04:31.750 --> 04:33.080
Qiushui. This place...

04:38.310 --> 04:40.159
is no venue for your nonsense.

04:40.630 --> 04:41.360
That's right!

04:41.360 --> 04:42.290
Mother. Father.

04:42.510 --> 04:44.310
The martial world is
in turmoil these days.

04:44.310 --> 04:46.750
Today I heard the Changle Escort Agency
met with trouble.

04:46.750 --> 04:48.010
I am deeply concerned.

04:48.240 --> 04:50.270
Adding more guards won't help much.

04:50.750 --> 04:53.150
We should use these searchlights instead—

04:53.630 --> 04:55.430
they guarantee complete coverage
with no blind spots.

04:55.430 --> 04:56.159
What lights?

04:59.870 --> 05:01.190
Permanent lights.

05:02.160 --> 05:05.290
Only constant illumination
can prevent sneak attacks!

05:06.360 --> 05:07.090
Sect Leader.

05:07.310 --> 05:08.110
We had not

05:08.110 --> 05:09.750
detected the wildcat
in the compound earlier,

05:09.750 --> 05:13.480
but the Third Young Master's
permanent lights just scared it away.

05:24.300 --> 05:24.770
Father.

05:25.970 --> 05:28.530
See? I can be of some use after all.

05:30.480 --> 05:32.680
Actually, competing with Yiren

05:32.680 --> 05:34.310
for the Younger Leadership last time—

05:34.310 --> 05:36.630
that wasn't really my intention...

05:37.920 --> 05:39.250
I haven't punished you,

05:39.630 --> 05:41.159
so don't push your luck.

05:41.720 --> 05:42.270
Now, go.

05:42.560 --> 05:45.159
You know
what you're supposed to do now, right?

05:50.510 --> 05:51.480
Sleep!

05:54.390 --> 05:55.290
That scared me to death!

05:55.290 --> 05:56.159
I'm off to bed then.

05:56.159 --> 05:58.750
Father and Mother,
you should turn in early too.

05:58.750 --> 05:59.210
This...

05:59.800 --> 06:00.860
This child, you...

06:02.800 --> 06:03.530
Old Madam Wu.

06:06.360 --> 06:06.890
Let's go.

06:14.430 --> 06:15.430
Guard this place.

06:15.510 --> 06:16.560
Let no one pass.

06:17.600 --> 06:18.070
Yes.

06:23.040 --> 06:24.640
If Old Madam Wu is truly here,

06:24.830 --> 06:27.630
it's only a matter of time
before trouble follows.

06:27.950 --> 06:29.040
Enough overthinking.

06:29.040 --> 06:31.900
I need to become the sect leader
as soon as possible.

06:55.560 --> 06:56.680
You startled me!

06:57.720 --> 06:58.850
Where are you off to?

06:59.000 --> 07:00.400
Don't go running off now.

07:00.920 --> 07:04.380
Just so you know, I'm not very familiar
with this place either.

07:04.950 --> 07:06.010
Just taking a walk.

07:06.430 --> 07:08.240
What? A walk?

07:08.870 --> 07:11.560
What kind of walk is this
in the middle of the night?

07:11.560 --> 07:12.490
Get inside, now.

07:12.870 --> 07:13.830
Perfect timing, actually.

07:13.830 --> 07:14.960
I need to talk to you.

07:16.030 --> 07:16.760
Hurry up!

07:17.360 --> 07:19.070
Come on, move! Get in!

07:33.560 --> 07:35.600
These uncles refuse to recommend me.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.600
I can't challenge Yiren
without their backing.

07:37.600 --> 07:40.200
Hey, you! Give me some ideas—
and make it quick!

07:45.000 --> 07:46.460
I've always wanted to ask:

07:46.920 --> 07:50.180
why are you so desperate to become
the Huanhua Sect Leader?

07:54.120 --> 07:55.040
Because...

07:56.720 --> 07:58.390
If I don't become the sect leader,

07:58.390 --> 08:01.240
there are things I cannot do,

08:02.160 --> 08:03.620
and changes I cannot make.

08:03.800 --> 08:05.070
Anyway, it's not something

08:05.070 --> 08:06.730
I can explain to you right now.

08:06.800 --> 08:07.870
But in this world,

08:08.510 --> 08:11.870
the more desperate you are for something,
the more it eludes you.

08:11.870 --> 08:13.270
If you won't help, fine.

08:13.270 --> 08:15.400
But why must you spread doom and gloom?

08:20.290 --> 08:20.880
Look,

08:22.000 --> 08:23.240
it's just the two of us here.

08:23.240 --> 08:25.040
And you—drop the act.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.520
Show me your secret weapon. Now.

08:27.830 --> 08:28.800
Come on,

08:29.360 --> 08:30.120
hurry up!

08:30.140 --> 08:31.260
Secret weapon?

08:33.030 --> 08:33.960
I don't have one.

08:35.840 --> 08:37.900
Then... what about the martial arts?

08:38.669 --> 08:41.070
You couldn't learn my martial arts anyway.

08:45.910 --> 08:46.750
That's odd...

08:47.510 --> 08:49.080
Aren't we friends already?

08:51.600 --> 08:54.510
Don't you have anything to give me?

09:04.200 --> 09:06.130
I have nothing to offer but myself.

09:07.240 --> 09:08.870
Are you out of your mind?

09:08.870 --> 09:10.600
Why are you being so sarcastic?

09:17.600 --> 09:18.660
Let me ask you this:

09:18.870 --> 09:20.270
once your injuries heal,

09:20.390 --> 09:22.520
can you help me destroy the Power Gang?

09:27.000 --> 09:28.240
How could I possibly
have that kind of power?

09:28.240 --> 09:29.370
You must be kidding.

09:32.510 --> 09:33.310
That's right.

09:34.030 --> 09:35.240
I was just asking.

09:40.390 --> 09:42.390
Perhaps we've just become friends,

09:43.080 --> 09:45.740
and the Friendship Meter
isn't high enough yet.

09:48.960 --> 09:50.360
Fine. Let's do this then.

10:11.960 --> 10:13.020
What are you doing?

10:14.720 --> 10:16.440
Mr. Feng, here's the thing.

10:17.440 --> 10:18.500
I've never been one

10:18.670 --> 10:20.600
for sleeping on the floor.

10:21.360 --> 10:23.160
I hope you don't mind it too much.

10:24.720 --> 10:27.200
Besides, something feels...

10:27.510 --> 10:28.600
off between us.

10:29.840 --> 10:32.500
But since we'll be stuck together
day and night,

10:33.150 --> 10:34.810
let's just... not dwell on it.

10:36.360 --> 10:37.160
Time to sleep.

10:37.670 --> 10:38.730
It's getting late.

10:40.010 --> 10:42.720
Oh, and blow out that candle, will you?

10:43.910 --> 10:44.480
Alright.

10:47.810 --> 10:51.140
This guy seems simple and gullible,

10:52.200 --> 10:55.060
yet he keeps surprising me
with frustrating moves.

10:55.390 --> 10:57.120
It seems like gaining his trust

10:57.550 --> 10:59.360
won't be as easy as I thought.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.050
Finally awake?

11:33.050 --> 11:34.580
Here, have some breakfast.

11:36.910 --> 11:37.640
No appetite.

11:39.510 --> 11:41.970
No appetite? So you're skipping breakfast?

11:42.270 --> 11:43.270
How odd!

11:48.000 --> 11:49.000
Hey, why the rush?

11:51.080 --> 11:52.390
I've got a question for you:

11:52.390 --> 11:54.150
got any plans for today?

11:54.870 --> 11:57.130
No plans. Just going out to clear my head.

11:58.750 --> 12:01.120
Clear your head? Not a bad idea.

12:01.440 --> 12:04.200
It might even help you
come up with a new plan.

12:06.630 --> 12:09.290
Do you really want to
follow me around like this?

12:10.670 --> 12:12.390
To be honest,
I don't really want to either.

12:12.390 --> 12:14.190
But I truly have no other choice.

12:14.750 --> 12:18.390
Fine. You need a recommendation
from a hero

12:18.750 --> 12:20.270
to challenge Yiren. Is that it?

12:20.270 --> 12:22.240
Exactly! I've told you all this.

12:22.240 --> 12:23.900
Are you going to help me or not?

12:33.150 --> 12:35.240
Kang Jiesheng, the son of Kang Chuyu.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.930
What about this Kang Jiesheng?

12:40.960 --> 12:42.600
Three years ago,

12:42.600 --> 12:45.270
Kang Jiesheng was escorting
disaster relief supplies,

12:45.270 --> 12:47.730
but gambled away
all the funds along the way.

12:48.240 --> 12:50.500
This should have ruined his reputation,

12:50.840 --> 12:53.040
yet he still poses as a young hero today.

12:53.200 --> 12:54.860
Tell me, how is that possible?

12:56.240 --> 12:58.700
So it was Uncle Kang
who covered it up for him.

12:59.080 --> 12:59.740
Brilliant.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.550
Kang Chuyu dug into his own pockets

13:03.550 --> 13:06.150
to cover the shortfall
and quell public anger.

13:06.270 --> 13:08.630
It shows how deeply
he dotes on Kang Jiesheng.

13:08.630 --> 13:11.000
So all you need to do
is get close to Kang Jiesheng,

13:11.000 --> 13:14.730
and Kang Chuyu's letter of recommendation
will naturally follow.

13:15.790 --> 13:18.630
Now that you say it,
it does sound like a solid plan.

13:19.670 --> 13:20.200
Let's go.

13:28.000 --> 13:29.060
Young Master Kang,

13:29.150 --> 13:30.670
as I made clear before,

13:31.080 --> 13:32.470
you and I are not kindred spirits.

13:32.470 --> 13:34.240
Please take these back.

13:37.080 --> 13:39.610
Won't you take a closer look
inside the chest?

13:40.440 --> 13:42.200
As the old saying goes,
"A fine blade suits a hero;

13:42.200 --> 13:43.530
jewels befit a beauty."

13:44.030 --> 13:46.360
This is but
a small token of my admiration.

13:46.440 --> 13:47.960
If anything catches your eye,

13:47.960 --> 13:48.960
you need only ask.

13:49.480 --> 13:52.550
In time,
perhaps we may turn into kindred spirits.

13:54.870 --> 13:57.030
True regard must spring
from a sincere heart.

13:57.030 --> 13:58.290
If what you say is true,

13:58.510 --> 13:59.960
then you demean

14:00.360 --> 14:01.820
both others and yourself.

14:01.910 --> 14:05.840
Xueyu, give me a chance
to get to know you better.

14:19.200 --> 14:21.860
Young Master Kang,
please check your behavior.

14:22.390 --> 14:23.270
Scum!

14:25.870 --> 14:26.630
Xiao Xueyu,

14:27.240 --> 14:29.200
you're merely an adopted daughter
of the Xiao family.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.550
Who are you to act so aloof?

14:30.550 --> 14:32.360
I, Kang Jiesheng,

14:32.470 --> 14:34.000
the sole heir of the Kang family,

14:34.000 --> 14:35.600
have shown an interest in you.

14:35.600 --> 14:37.400
You should consider it an honor.

14:37.960 --> 14:38.990
What's with the pointing?

14:38.990 --> 14:39.440
I—

14:39.960 --> 14:42.870
Young Master Kang,
it seems to me you're severely injured.

14:42.870 --> 14:44.470
Allow me to check your pulse.

14:47.840 --> 14:48.970
What severe injury?

14:49.600 --> 14:51.840
The skin on your face
is about to fall off.

14:51.840 --> 14:53.200
That qualifies as a severe injury.

14:53.200 --> 14:55.320
Or perhaps you've
simply decided to discard it.

14:55.320 --> 14:55.840
Isn't that right, Xueyu?

14:55.840 --> 14:56.240
You...

14:56.910 --> 14:57.440
Alright.

14:58.080 --> 14:59.720
It seems your father's lesson yesterday

14:59.720 --> 15:00.960
wasn't enough.

15:02.320 --> 15:02.910
"Mother,

15:03.080 --> 15:05.290
I... I want to become
the young leader."

15:06.510 --> 15:08.110
And you think you're worthy?

15:08.510 --> 15:09.040
What now?

15:09.790 --> 15:12.720
Are you asking for
another lesson in manners from me?

15:13.870 --> 15:16.480
You have come to the Xiao family
and yet show no respect.

15:16.480 --> 15:18.790
It seems someone like you
is just asking for a lesson.

15:18.790 --> 15:19.720
-Qiushui!
-I...

15:24.320 --> 15:24.840
Yiren.

15:25.360 --> 15:25.910
Yiren.

15:27.630 --> 15:29.420
Yiren, he's bullying me.

15:31.840 --> 15:34.600
Mr. Xiao,
Qiushui is utterly disrespectful.

15:35.440 --> 15:36.720
It's not Qiushui's fault.

15:36.720 --> 15:37.440
About this matter...

15:37.440 --> 15:38.570
I heard everything.

15:39.120 --> 15:41.920
Young Master Kang,
Qiushui is reckless by nature.

15:42.910 --> 15:44.370
I apologize on his behalf.

15:44.550 --> 15:48.280
However, your words and actions
moments ago
were highly improper.

15:48.720 --> 15:50.750
Xueyu grew up in the Xiao family.

15:51.670 --> 15:53.510
We all regard her as one of our own.

15:53.510 --> 15:54.970
Xueyu, Father always said

15:55.320 --> 15:57.790
that a child's marriage
should be their own decision.

15:57.790 --> 15:59.250
Therefore, your marriage

15:59.270 --> 16:01.000
should also follow your heart.

16:01.750 --> 16:03.750
No one can force you into anything.

16:07.630 --> 16:09.690
Did you hear that, Young Master Kang?

16:09.840 --> 16:12.080
And you think
you're good enough for my sister?

16:12.080 --> 16:13.940
Get that thought out of your head.

16:14.240 --> 16:15.960
Why don't you
take a look at yourself in a puddle?

16:15.960 --> 16:18.150
You wouldn't even get on the waiting list.

16:18.150 --> 16:20.000
Xiao Qiushui, your words are too mean!

16:20.000 --> 16:21.060
Young Master Kang,

16:23.200 --> 16:24.840
morning tea is ready
in the front hall.

16:24.840 --> 16:26.960
Uncle Kang is awaiting your presence.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.090
Please do not delay.

16:30.030 --> 16:30.960
Go, now!

16:32.550 --> 16:33.120
Go!

16:41.320 --> 16:43.000
Yiren, you know what?

16:43.320 --> 16:45.550
That scumbag doesn't have
an honest bone in his body.

16:45.550 --> 16:47.600
Alright, that's enough from you.

16:49.720 --> 16:51.510
Of course, we are family.

16:51.960 --> 16:53.490
It is my duty to protect you.

16:55.120 --> 16:58.200
Besides, although the Kang family
is known for their chivalry,

16:58.200 --> 17:00.080
Kang Jiesheng has a gambling problem.

17:00.080 --> 17:01.750
An alliance through marriage with him

17:01.750 --> 17:04.160
would likely tarnish the reputation
of our Huanhua Sect.

17:04.160 --> 17:04.960
That's right.

17:07.440 --> 17:08.589
Rest assured, Xueyu.

17:08.589 --> 17:11.349
I will find you a match from a family

17:11.349 --> 17:13.920
whose strength and honor
rival those of our Huanhua Sect.

17:13.920 --> 17:16.380
Only such a worthy alliance
would befit you.

17:17.270 --> 17:18.270
Thank you, Yiren.

17:19.030 --> 17:21.310
But if I can stay by
Father and Mother's side for life,

17:21.310 --> 17:23.710
roam the martial world and uphold justice,

17:23.790 --> 17:25.310
I would be content.

17:26.160 --> 17:27.720
I'll go prepare the herbal medicine now.

17:27.720 --> 17:28.319
All right.

17:33.510 --> 17:36.880
Yiren, there are many ways
to achieve mutual benefit.

17:37.440 --> 17:38.900
But a lifelong commitment

17:39.240 --> 17:41.240
should never be used as a bargaining chip.

17:41.240 --> 17:43.100
I would never wrong my own sister.

17:43.920 --> 17:45.550
If a marriage alliance
is to be considered,

17:45.550 --> 17:47.410
it must be with someone she likes.

17:47.790 --> 17:48.720
And another thing—

17:48.720 --> 17:50.320
I haven't addressed you yet.

17:51.070 --> 17:52.490
The Xiao family
has a reputation to uphold.

17:52.490 --> 17:54.720
Even if you were in the right moments ago,

17:54.720 --> 17:57.250
your lack of decorum
was still unacceptable.

17:57.960 --> 18:00.030
Mother says you've shown
newfound ambition lately,

18:00.030 --> 18:02.440
aspiring to compete for
the Young Leadership.

18:02.440 --> 18:04.700
But do you know why no one recommends you?

18:06.510 --> 18:09.200
You are still too young and impulsive.

18:11.160 --> 18:13.400
Later, go have tea with Kang Jiesheng.

18:13.890 --> 18:16.220
Consider it a gesture of reconciliation.

18:17.270 --> 18:18.070
I'm not going.

18:18.830 --> 18:20.510
Don't be stubborn. Go now.

18:26.160 --> 18:27.690
Fine. I'll go along with it.

18:34.720 --> 18:36.320
By offending Kang Jiesheng,

18:36.400 --> 18:38.240
even if you go to offer him tea now,

18:38.240 --> 18:41.440
it will be nearly impossible
to gain his recommendation.

18:50.310 --> 18:52.040
Just because I've offended him

18:52.160 --> 18:53.590
doesn't mean I'll fail.

18:54.640 --> 18:56.400
Since I've already offended him,

18:56.400 --> 18:58.060
I might as well finish the job.

18:58.750 --> 19:01.350
Besides, I still have you to help me.

19:09.550 --> 19:11.680
You want to gamble with Kang Jiesheng?

19:11.920 --> 19:12.480
Exactly!

19:14.270 --> 19:15.920
Since he bullied Xueyu,

19:16.510 --> 19:19.000
I have to make him pay dearly for it.

19:21.240 --> 19:21.830
Mr. Feng,

19:23.160 --> 19:25.020
lend me your priceless treasure,

19:25.200 --> 19:26.200
the Hanhao Stone.

19:26.790 --> 19:29.590
This time,
I'm going to make a serious bet with him.

19:32.720 --> 19:37.550
Mr. Xiao, this stone of mine is
exceptionally rare in this world.

19:39.960 --> 19:41.310
The blade wielded by Hero Kang Chuyu

19:41.310 --> 19:43.310
was forged with this very material.

19:43.680 --> 19:47.410
It is a key reason he can unleash
the "Sun-Gazing Sword Technique".

19:50.400 --> 19:51.800
It took me immense effort

19:52.070 --> 19:53.870
to obtain just this small piece.

19:57.480 --> 19:58.030
Great!

20:00.920 --> 20:02.880
Now hand it over.

20:13.720 --> 20:15.230
Come on, I need to borrow it!

20:15.230 --> 20:17.710
Mr. Feng, no need to be so stingy.

20:22.200 --> 20:24.070
That's not how a true friend acts.

20:24.270 --> 20:26.000
I'm not that stingy, really...

20:32.150 --> 20:32.880
Hand it over.

20:36.960 --> 20:37.680
Mr. Feng.

20:39.420 --> 20:40.750
Mr. Feng, set your mind at rest.

20:40.750 --> 20:43.080
If I win this time,
I will repay you double.

20:43.720 --> 20:44.450
My goodness!

20:45.480 --> 20:47.340
This truly is a remarkable stone!

20:52.110 --> 20:54.680
Without this stone, Kang Jiesheng

20:54.680 --> 20:56.920
has never been able to unleash
the technique his father taught him.

20:56.920 --> 20:58.030
Set your mind at ease.

20:58.030 --> 20:59.630
He will desperately want it.

20:59.920 --> 21:02.830
This time, I'm going to
make him pay through the nose.

21:02.830 --> 21:04.360
I'll clean him out for good.

21:05.000 --> 21:06.070
Since it's a gamble,

21:06.070 --> 21:07.930
how can you be so sure he won't win?

21:13.110 --> 21:15.110
These dice are loaded with mercury.

21:15.270 --> 21:17.470
They'll land on whatever number I want.

21:19.030 --> 21:21.750
This time, he won't stand a chance.

21:28.590 --> 21:32.520
Do you think this paltry stuff is enough
to bet against my Hanhao Stone?

21:33.200 --> 21:34.350
But this is gold!

21:35.350 --> 21:37.640
Gold? So what?

21:38.310 --> 21:40.440
You think I've never seen gold before?

21:40.720 --> 21:43.120
It doesn't even
compare to my Hanhao Stone.

21:43.550 --> 21:45.070
Let's go. The game's off!

21:45.310 --> 21:47.000
Then what do you want?

21:57.310 --> 21:59.910
That thumb ring on your hand
looks rather fine.

22:00.310 --> 22:02.550
Add it to the pot, and we have a bet.

22:03.750 --> 22:04.550
Xiao Qiushui,

22:05.200 --> 22:07.590
this is a treasured heirloom
of the Kang family,

22:07.590 --> 22:10.270
and also the Young Leadership Token
of the Kang family.

22:10.270 --> 22:11.470
Treasured heirloom?

22:11.720 --> 22:13.680
So what if it's your treasured heirloom?

22:13.680 --> 22:15.080
This Hanhao Stone of mine

22:15.440 --> 22:17.370
is one of a kind in the entire world.

22:17.440 --> 22:18.550
Enough. Do we have a bet or not?

22:18.550 --> 22:20.000
If not, forget it.
Enough with the nonsense.

22:20.000 --> 22:21.200
Let's go. Break it up.

22:21.270 --> 22:21.750
Fine!

22:28.110 --> 22:28.910
Let's do this!

22:35.270 --> 22:36.000
High roll.

22:36.680 --> 22:38.070
One round.

22:42.590 --> 22:44.750
A single round settles it all.

23:18.350 --> 23:20.150
Double sixes! Boxcars! Twelve!

23:22.160 --> 23:23.070
Twelve!

23:24.640 --> 23:26.680
Twelve. Your turn.

23:28.030 --> 23:28.880
Not bad at all.

23:29.590 --> 23:31.250
The dice are hot for you today.

23:36.310 --> 23:37.350
Also twelve!

23:40.400 --> 23:41.070
The Third Young Master is incredible!

23:41.070 --> 23:42.270
I have twelve as well!

23:42.510 --> 23:43.310
Xiao Qiushui,

23:44.350 --> 23:46.070
do you acknowledge

23:47.680 --> 23:49.400
the rules of gambling
in the martial world?

23:49.400 --> 23:51.060
Of course I acknowledge them.

23:51.400 --> 23:53.460
It's good that you acknowledge them.

23:53.640 --> 23:56.270
Cheating incurs a tenfold penalty.

23:58.310 --> 24:01.480
And your dice... are loaded with mercury.

24:06.480 --> 24:07.510
How could this be?

24:08.790 --> 24:11.000
No mercury! None at all!

24:11.200 --> 24:11.860
Where is it?

24:12.790 --> 24:13.990
Where's the mercury?

24:14.240 --> 24:15.680
Exactly! Nothing here!

24:15.680 --> 24:17.610
No mercury here! Where would it be?

24:17.750 --> 24:19.400
What did you say just now?

24:19.680 --> 24:21.480
A tenfold penalty for cheating?

24:32.680 --> 24:34.750
Third Young Master won!
Kang Jiesheng totally cheated!

24:34.750 --> 24:36.680
How is this possible? Impossible!

24:36.750 --> 24:38.510
How dare he frame our Third Young Master?

24:38.510 --> 24:39.640
This is outrageous!

24:40.110 --> 24:41.370
Pay a tenfold penalty!

24:42.440 --> 24:43.270
Cheating?

24:44.440 --> 24:46.570
You should have your tendons severed.

24:46.790 --> 24:48.160
A pity... I find it too dirty for me.

24:48.160 --> 24:50.160
Mr. Feng, let's split the winnings.

24:50.550 --> 24:51.000
Wait!

24:52.480 --> 24:54.030
When did you switch my dice?

24:54.410 --> 24:55.540
But you just said...

25:00.260 --> 25:01.870
Alright, you two!

25:02.510 --> 25:04.510
You actually set me up and played me!

25:05.960 --> 25:07.550
Right, it's time to eat.

25:07.880 --> 25:08.530
Let's call it.

25:08.530 --> 25:09.130
The game is over.

25:09.130 --> 25:11.130
-Yes, Young Master.
-Xiao Qiushui.

25:14.120 --> 25:15.230
After all this,

25:15.720 --> 25:17.320
isn't it just for Xiao Xueyu?

25:17.680 --> 25:19.340
After all you've done for her,

25:22.030 --> 25:27.480
could it be... you've been having
a secret affair all along?

25:28.030 --> 25:31.360
What is he talking about?
He's just rattled because he lost!

25:31.830 --> 25:33.070
I knew it!

25:33.430 --> 25:35.290
No wonder she refused to marry me.

25:35.310 --> 25:36.110
So this is why—

25:36.750 --> 25:40.440
there's been something going on
between you two all along!

25:51.880 --> 25:53.540
My Young Leadership Token...

25:53.960 --> 25:54.760
In this world,

25:56.550 --> 25:59.070
some are born under a lucky star.

26:00.350 --> 26:02.810
They have
all they desire without striving,

26:03.680 --> 26:06.000
and stand high without ever working.

26:07.790 --> 26:08.640
In time,

26:10.830 --> 26:13.490
they truly believe
they can look down on others.

26:18.030 --> 26:19.640
Today, I'm telling you—

26:20.960 --> 26:22.590
that doesn't work on me.

26:23.350 --> 26:27.750
Xiao Qiushui,
it seems you have a death wish.

26:27.960 --> 26:28.520
Jieshen.

26:39.670 --> 26:42.260
Father! Yiren!

26:43.510 --> 26:44.000
Father!

26:44.310 --> 26:46.270
Xiao Qiushui destroyed my thumb ring,
the Young Leadership Token!

26:46.270 --> 26:48.070
I saw everything! You... you...

26:48.200 --> 26:49.800
humiliated me beyond words!

26:50.070 --> 26:51.480
I told you to have tea
with Young Master Kang!

26:51.480 --> 26:53.540
How did you end up in a gambling match?

26:55.750 --> 26:57.920
Return every coin you took!

26:58.310 --> 26:59.910
I... I didn't take anything!

27:00.830 --> 27:01.590
Chuyu...

27:04.070 --> 27:05.930
You don't have to... Just keep it.

27:09.680 --> 27:11.610
Apologize to Uncle Kang right now!

27:16.160 --> 27:18.560
Uncle Kang, my discourtesy as your junior.

27:18.830 --> 27:20.690
My apologies. Please forgive me.

27:21.310 --> 27:22.830
The thanks should be mine.

27:23.350 --> 27:24.510
Jiesheng usually

27:24.510 --> 27:26.100
keeps too many bad influences around.

27:26.100 --> 27:27.900
I wish to see him make friends

27:27.930 --> 27:30.030
with sincere ones like Third Young Master,

27:30.030 --> 27:31.240
who can wake him up.

27:34.110 --> 27:35.970
This matter is over and done with.

27:36.440 --> 27:39.310
After lunch, all the Xiaos gather here.

27:40.030 --> 27:43.000
I have a matter of importance to announce.
Dismissed.

27:43.000 --> 27:43.400
Yes.

27:43.400 --> 27:45.400
Chuyu, I apologize for any offense.

27:46.270 --> 27:47.000
Thank you.

27:47.000 --> 27:47.800
Safe travels.

27:49.110 --> 27:49.750
Let's go.

27:56.070 --> 27:56.600
Let's go.

27:57.920 --> 27:59.320
Did I say you could leave?

28:02.070 --> 28:02.920
Not you.

28:07.070 --> 28:08.130
You—get over here.

28:12.070 --> 28:13.200
Father, I was wrong.

28:15.830 --> 28:16.790
Are you trying to hit your father?

28:16.790 --> 28:18.750
No! I wouldn't dare!

28:21.090 --> 28:24.950
You... you're always causing trouble
and truly deserve punishment.

28:27.350 --> 28:29.510
But that fine speech of yours

28:30.880 --> 28:32.480
was rather pleasing to hear.

28:32.960 --> 28:34.490
Remember—don't get cocky.

28:35.440 --> 28:37.790
I'll hold off on the penalty.

28:39.030 --> 28:40.270
Don't repeat this!

28:41.440 --> 28:41.960
Yes.

28:48.830 --> 28:50.400
By doing this,
Uncle Kang will probably

28:50.400 --> 28:53.590
give me that
letter of recommendation, right?

28:55.640 --> 28:58.070
Anyway, I'm doing it.

29:06.510 --> 29:09.970
Kang Chuyu actually wrote you
that letter of recommendation.

29:10.240 --> 29:11.000
Years ago,

29:12.000 --> 29:14.400
Uncle Kang covered up his son's scandal,

29:14.720 --> 29:16.150
embezzlement of charity funds,

29:16.150 --> 29:17.880
while condoning his gambling.

29:18.110 --> 29:19.110
Today's cover-up

29:19.240 --> 29:20.570
follows the same logic.

29:21.830 --> 29:23.960
The more Kang Jiesheng disgraced himself,

29:23.960 --> 29:26.680
the more Uncle Kang
must maintain a generous facade.

29:26.680 --> 29:28.280
However unwilling at heart,

29:28.640 --> 29:30.170
he's compelled to grant it.

29:30.400 --> 29:31.200
After today,

29:31.880 --> 29:34.610
both father and son
must hold a grudge against me.

29:35.110 --> 29:36.770
We've truly forged bad blood.

29:37.070 --> 29:40.000
You know quite a lot, don't you?

29:40.350 --> 29:41.720
It's all about social nuances, after all.

29:41.720 --> 29:43.320
The first lesson in a career.

29:43.960 --> 29:44.640
Career?

29:47.110 --> 29:49.750
See? Our first collaboration

29:50.400 --> 29:52.310
got us this recommendation letter.

29:52.310 --> 29:55.350
This should strengthen our friendship,

29:55.960 --> 29:58.240
so my settings can restore faster.

29:58.680 --> 29:59.210
Alright,

29:59.310 --> 30:00.510
enough talk for now.

30:00.960 --> 30:02.880
I'm going to find my father.

30:03.070 --> 30:04.350
You—don't wander off.

30:13.880 --> 30:17.070
The Huanhua Sect is gathered here today

30:18.030 --> 30:22.110
for 2 announcements.

30:22.960 --> 30:23.550
First:

30:24.000 --> 30:26.480
recent traces of Marching Pills

30:27.110 --> 30:29.350
were found in Guangling.

30:29.720 --> 30:30.580
Marching Pill?

30:31.270 --> 30:32.830
Wasn't the Baicao Valley

30:32.830 --> 30:34.360
wiped out over a decade ago?

30:34.550 --> 30:36.270
How could there be
surviving Marching Pills?

30:36.270 --> 30:37.400
This is suspicious—

30:38.440 --> 30:42.100
hence all righteous sects
in the martial world are sending envoys

30:42.110 --> 30:43.770
to investigate in Guangling.

30:44.030 --> 30:47.110
Our Huanhua Sect
must take responsibility, too.

30:48.000 --> 30:48.640
Yiren,

30:49.030 --> 30:50.880
tomorrow you will take Kaiyan

30:51.270 --> 30:53.830
and lead the Tiger Guards with Shinian

30:54.400 --> 30:56.750
to Guangling Villa.

30:57.270 --> 30:59.800
Investigate the truth
of the Marching Pills.

31:00.640 --> 31:01.350
Yes.

31:02.240 --> 31:05.030
Father, I wish to go
with Yiren and Kaiyan.

31:06.160 --> 31:08.350
Having grown up immersed
in the Huanhua Sect,

31:08.350 --> 31:10.720
I aspire to become a hero
like you and Mother,

31:10.720 --> 31:12.830
and make contributions
to the martial world.

31:12.830 --> 31:14.830
Now that my skills have progressed,

31:15.310 --> 31:17.000
and I excel in the Healing Arts.

31:17.000 --> 31:17.920
I can be of help.

31:20.270 --> 31:23.160
Does your mother agree with this?

31:26.160 --> 31:28.480
It would be good to gain more experience.

31:32.430 --> 31:33.000
Great!

31:34.030 --> 31:35.690
With your mother's approval,

31:36.920 --> 31:38.030
I consent.

31:38.730 --> 31:39.290
So—

31:39.910 --> 31:41.510
once the supplies are ready,

31:41.790 --> 31:44.750
you may set out for Guangling
with your brothers.

31:45.270 --> 31:46.330
Thank you, Father.

31:51.030 --> 31:52.880
The second announcement

31:53.920 --> 31:55.380
is about family business.

31:55.750 --> 31:58.110
I am now in my 50s

31:58.790 --> 32:02.240
and have led the Huanhua Sect
for many years.

32:03.270 --> 32:04.200
In recent years,

32:04.640 --> 32:06.350
Yiren has assisted greatly,

32:06.730 --> 32:08.050
and wishes to

32:08.550 --> 32:11.440
take full charge
of Guangling Villa for me.

32:12.030 --> 32:13.050
I originally intended

32:13.050 --> 32:15.580
to hold the ceremony in 6 days,

32:16.030 --> 32:17.640
but since you must depart,

32:18.350 --> 32:19.750
we will advance the date—

32:19.830 --> 32:22.720
and pass the Young Leadership position
to you.

32:26.350 --> 32:26.960
Yiren.

32:28.590 --> 32:29.110
Yes.

32:30.200 --> 32:34.350
This is the Huanhua Sect Leader's Token—

32:34.920 --> 32:37.270
from this day forth, you will be...

32:37.270 --> 32:37.830
Wait!

32:47.700 --> 32:51.030
Father, this is the recommendation letter
from Uncle Kang.

32:52.950 --> 32:55.750
I wish to compete fairly
for the Young Leadership.

32:56.680 --> 32:57.680
It's upside down.

33:00.720 --> 33:02.450
You're holding it upside down!

33:07.810 --> 33:08.670
Sorry, Father.

33:09.790 --> 33:10.850
Please have a look.

33:11.720 --> 33:12.980
Just check it, Father.

33:13.110 --> 33:13.640
Mother!

33:14.030 --> 33:14.920
Just take a look, won't you?

33:14.920 --> 33:16.450
What's the harm in looking?

33:18.030 --> 33:20.590
See? It's really a recommendation letter
from Kang Chuyu!

33:20.590 --> 33:21.390
It's genuine!

33:24.880 --> 33:27.410
Well, go on and examine it
with your son, then.

33:30.510 --> 33:31.200
Qiushui,

33:31.790 --> 33:33.640
I dare not even compete with Yiren.

33:33.640 --> 33:35.240
Where did you get such nerve?

33:36.830 --> 33:37.790
Qiushui,

33:38.160 --> 33:40.240
now that you have
Uncle Kang's recommendation,

33:40.240 --> 33:41.440
it proves that our Xiao family

33:41.440 --> 33:43.170
has gained another young hero.

33:43.200 --> 33:44.260
This makes me glad.

33:44.920 --> 33:46.400
When you are ready,

33:46.750 --> 33:48.440
feel free to challenge me anytime.

33:48.440 --> 33:49.450
Yiren.

33:49.480 --> 33:50.240
Qiushui,

33:50.880 --> 33:51.640
all these years,

33:51.640 --> 33:54.030
Yiren has fulfilled
the duties of the Young Leadership.

33:54.030 --> 33:55.250
If you are serious about this,

33:55.250 --> 33:57.210
you should first gain a few more

33:57.240 --> 33:57.880
years of experience in the martial world.

33:57.880 --> 33:59.810
you may properly challenge Yiren.

34:00.200 --> 34:01.830
Mother, I really can't wait!

34:01.830 --> 34:02.830
I don't have the time.

34:02.830 --> 34:03.630
-Qiushui.
-I…

34:05.160 --> 34:06.110
You're still so young!

34:06.110 --> 34:07.840
How could you not have the time?

34:09.800 --> 34:13.040
Yiren, could you temporarily
pass the role to me for a year?

34:13.040 --> 34:14.550
If not a year, even half a year would do.

34:14.550 --> 34:16.670
I will definitely return
the Young Leadership to you.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.230
Could you?

34:17.230 --> 34:17.800
Qiushui,

34:18.150 --> 34:19.350
the Young Leadership

34:19.590 --> 34:21.520
cannot be passed around like a toy.

34:21.800 --> 34:23.670
I thought you were
finally seeking progress,

34:23.670 --> 34:25.280
but you treat it as a game.

34:25.880 --> 34:27.480
Then I cannot tolerate this.

34:27.590 --> 34:29.250
Enough! Stop messing around.

34:29.400 --> 34:30.600
Do not disappoint me.

34:32.630 --> 34:34.960
Yiren, I'm not messing around!

34:35.440 --> 34:37.030
This concerns every life

34:37.030 --> 34:38.159
in the Huanhua Sect!

34:39.070 --> 34:39.679
Yiren!

34:39.840 --> 34:40.400
What?

34:40.920 --> 34:41.440
Yiren!

34:44.840 --> 34:46.150
Father, Mother,

34:46.670 --> 34:47.670
then by the rules—

34:48.150 --> 34:49.480
I accept the challenge!

34:54.320 --> 34:54.920
Very well.

34:55.710 --> 34:57.710
Since you have the recommendation,

34:58.440 --> 34:59.970
we must honor your request.

35:00.670 --> 35:01.150
Good!

35:01.710 --> 35:03.230
Before Yiren departs,

35:03.800 --> 35:06.330
we shall arrange a duel
between the two of you.

35:06.880 --> 35:07.480
Agreed?

35:09.230 --> 35:09.710
Yes.

35:11.920 --> 35:13.550
Naturally, it's a good thing

35:13.840 --> 35:16.100
that Qiushui shows such determination.

35:16.150 --> 35:16.950
Prepare well.

35:18.230 --> 35:21.960
Yiren, go and prepare
the supplies quickly.

35:25.070 --> 35:25.630
Yes.

35:29.000 --> 35:29.560
Let's go.

35:35.360 --> 35:37.760
Qiushui, are you really
going through with this duel?

35:37.760 --> 35:40.020
Qiushui, this still doesn't seem right.

35:40.070 --> 35:41.470
Yiren is highly skilled—

35:41.960 --> 35:44.070
you'll only make a fool of yourself
against him.

35:44.070 --> 35:46.110
Let me talk to Father again,

35:46.440 --> 35:48.040
and have him drop the matter.

35:48.480 --> 35:51.110
Kaiyan, thank you for your concern.

35:53.150 --> 35:56.400
I do have reasons beyond my control.

35:57.030 --> 35:58.890
There's no need to worry about me.

35:59.670 --> 36:01.270
If I look like a fool, so be it.

36:01.360 --> 36:02.220
I'm not afraid.

36:02.510 --> 36:03.840
Qiushui speaks wisely.

36:04.230 --> 36:05.430
Since he has decided,

36:05.440 --> 36:06.440
let him try.

36:06.760 --> 36:07.800
Even if he is embarrassed,

36:07.800 --> 36:09.130
he will have no regrets.

36:09.190 --> 36:10.850
Kaiyan, set your mind at rest—

36:11.000 --> 36:12.460
Yiren won't hurt Qiushui.

36:15.190 --> 36:16.550
Come, train with me.

36:16.800 --> 36:18.330
Mother, where are we going?

36:18.960 --> 36:20.760
No peeking, both of you!

36:22.150 --> 36:22.680
Let's go!

36:27.670 --> 36:29.360
The tea today is quite good.

36:29.360 --> 36:29.960
Yes, it is.

36:30.480 --> 36:31.740
Why are you here alone?

36:32.840 --> 36:35.190
My Lord, all servants
hired in the past 3 years

36:35.190 --> 36:37.670
were dismissed
by the Xiao family before noon.

36:37.670 --> 36:40.070
I can only stay until dusk
for the handover.

36:42.760 --> 36:43.550
Lately,

36:43.880 --> 36:47.210
that Xiao Qiushui has been keeping me
completely occupied.

36:47.510 --> 36:49.030
I was just about to request all of you—

36:49.030 --> 36:50.960
why were you all suddenly dismissed?

36:50.960 --> 36:52.000
I've no idea, either.

36:52.000 --> 36:53.880
The order was given by Third Young Master.

36:53.880 --> 36:54.540
But My Lord,

36:54.880 --> 36:56.960
after you went to investigate
the Qianzhu Garden,

36:56.960 --> 36:58.360
the Xiao family sent a palanquin...

36:58.360 --> 36:59.630
to the Sword Manor.

37:00.800 --> 37:02.050
Did you see who was inside it?

37:02.050 --> 37:02.650
I did not.

37:05.070 --> 37:07.280
You will soon face Yiren in the duel.

37:07.510 --> 37:09.070
I am so worried about you.

37:11.070 --> 37:13.360
Mother, do you also think
I'll definitely lose?

37:13.360 --> 37:13.880
Yes.

37:16.070 --> 37:17.190
So I have decided—

37:18.150 --> 37:21.630
I will pass my best skills on to you.

37:25.030 --> 37:26.960
Mother, you must be joking!

37:27.400 --> 37:29.230
Your best skill is the Cross Wisdom Sword—

37:29.230 --> 37:30.840
I cannot master that in a single day!

37:30.840 --> 37:32.110
Of course not!

37:32.470 --> 37:35.030
The Cross Wisdom Sword is
a public-facing skill.

37:35.030 --> 37:36.920
Before I met your father,

37:37.150 --> 37:39.070
I relied on my true best skill—

37:39.150 --> 37:41.210
in duels, I was never truly defeated,

37:41.320 --> 37:43.050
but I did not always win either.

37:43.070 --> 37:44.030
Never lost—

37:44.880 --> 37:46.280
but neither won nor lost?

37:48.550 --> 37:50.010
What kind of skill is that?

37:50.320 --> 37:51.320
Watch me closely!

38:02.110 --> 38:04.190
First move: Pheasant Ascends to Roof—

38:04.190 --> 38:06.720
use this when you are ambushed
on flat ground.

38:13.590 --> 38:14.360
This—

38:14.590 --> 38:15.880
is the second move.

38:17.320 --> 38:19.590
The third move is crucial.

38:34.150 --> 38:34.760
Xilou?

38:45.590 --> 38:47.000
Mother, what is that smell?

38:47.000 --> 38:48.880
What underhanded tricks are you using?

38:48.880 --> 38:51.670
Correct!
This is the Three Styles of Boldness.

38:53.630 --> 38:54.510
Back in the day,

38:54.960 --> 38:56.630
with these three moves,

38:56.880 --> 38:58.280
even when I couldn't win,

38:58.590 --> 39:00.120
I could retreat unscathed.

39:01.840 --> 39:02.960
If not for your father—

39:02.960 --> 39:05.070
insisting on being a righteous hero,

39:05.190 --> 39:06.840
forbidding me to use this style—

39:06.840 --> 39:09.570
it would have been
perfected and expanded by now.

39:12.110 --> 39:12.970
Remember that?

39:13.190 --> 39:13.850
I remember.

39:14.150 --> 39:16.110
Mom, these moves are really bold.

39:25.000 --> 39:27.150
I know Yiren well.

39:27.280 --> 39:28.880
Though usually reasonable,

39:29.030 --> 39:31.190
his reputation is very important to him.

39:31.190 --> 39:32.790
I know you have clever ideas,

39:33.150 --> 39:34.350
but still be careful—

39:34.840 --> 39:35.800
I don't want

39:35.800 --> 39:37.840
my youngest son
to get wounded by the eldest,

39:37.840 --> 39:39.970
leaving me with nowhere to turn to cry!

39:40.480 --> 39:42.540
Please set your mind at ease, Mother.

39:43.190 --> 39:43.920
Do your best!

39:46.800 --> 39:47.590
Remember!

39:48.280 --> 39:49.550
If you cannot win, yield—

39:49.550 --> 39:51.210
never push yourself too hard.

39:58.150 --> 40:00.900
[Xiao's Sword Manor]

40:07.030 --> 40:08.430
It's so heavily guarded—

40:08.840 --> 40:10.300
seems it's here after all.

40:11.590 --> 40:13.840
Xiao Qiushui caused
that scene the other day,

40:13.840 --> 40:15.500
making Xiao Xilou so vigilant

40:15.920 --> 40:17.710
that he sent Old Madam Wu
to the Sword Manor overnight.

40:17.710 --> 40:19.170
Such a troublesome place!

40:20.510 --> 40:22.030
All that effort to push Xiao Qiushui

40:22.030 --> 40:23.890
into a duel and carve out this time

40:24.070 --> 40:25.000
was for nothing.

40:55.590 --> 40:57.520
Greetings, Mr. Xiao and Mrs. Xiao.

41:12.230 --> 41:13.150
Let's begin.

41:33.590 --> 41:35.720
I did not expect you to be ready so soon.

41:36.150 --> 41:38.710
Then today, I will face you in the duel.

41:40.400 --> 41:42.880
Yiren, I have a proposal.

41:43.400 --> 41:44.480
As we are family,

41:44.760 --> 41:46.480
crossing blades with real weapons

41:46.480 --> 41:47.610
is not quite proper.

41:47.880 --> 41:50.920
How about replacing 1 major duel
with 3 smaller matches?

41:50.920 --> 41:51.920
What do you think?

41:53.920 --> 41:55.280
How will these smaller matches work?

41:55.280 --> 41:58.140
Internal energy, lightness skill,
and precision.

42:05.960 --> 42:07.960
Good, then have it your way.

42:18.190 --> 42:20.320
Yiren, for the first round,

42:21.030 --> 42:22.160
let's see which of us

42:22.190 --> 42:24.800
can attract more iron rods wins.

42:26.630 --> 42:29.670
Qiushui, you challenge Yiren
directly in internal energy—

42:29.670 --> 42:31.270
something so solid and real.

42:31.800 --> 42:33.660
What trick are you up to this time?

42:37.360 --> 42:39.280
Sure, as you wish.

42:53.440 --> 42:54.550
Truly impressive!

42:56.590 --> 42:57.440
Now, my turn.
